1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
FlowIA — Booking SaaS for hair salons & service businesses

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Why: merchants want their bookings in Google Calendar too

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Merchant logs into FlowIA

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Settings → Reservations → Synchronization

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:15,000
OAuth consent — calendar.events scope only (least privilege)

6
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Connected. Tokens stored encrypted (AES-256-GCM)

7
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:40,000
New appointment created in FlowIA

8
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Appointment instantly mirrored to Google Calendar

9
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Merchant can disconnect anytime — tokens revoked & deleted
